{"content":[{"c":["HOPHRA"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Son of Psammis, ruler over Egypt from 589–570 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"}," during the 26th dynasty. Called Pharaoh Hophra in ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.44.30","r":"Jer.44.30","rawR":"Jer.44.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.44.30","value":"Jer.44.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jeremiah 44:30"},", although he is alluded to several other times during the divided kingdom period (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.37.5","r":"Jer.37.5","rawR":"Jer.37.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.37.5","value":"Jer.37.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 37:5"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.43.8-13","r":"Jer.43.8-13","rawR":"Jer.43.8-13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.43.8-13","value":"Jer.43.8-13"}],"t":"ref","v":"43:8-13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.29.1-3","r":"Ezek.29.1-3","rawR":"Ezek.29.1-3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.29.1-3","value":"Ezek.29.1-3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 29:1-3"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.31.1-18","r":"Ezek.31.1-18","rawR":"Ezek.31.1-18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.31.1-18","value":"Ezek.31.1-18"}],"t":"ref","v":"31:1-18"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["He came to power after the death of his father, and in 589 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"}," marched into Judah against Nebuchadnezzar and the Babylonians in order to assist Zedekiah. Apparently he retreated before superior forces, Jerusalem was overthrown in 586 (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.37.5-8","r":"Jer.37.5-8","rawR":"Jer.37.5-8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.37.5-8","value":"Jer.37.5-8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 37:5-8"},"), and Hophra was killed as prophesied (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.44.30","r":"Jer.44.30","rawR":"Jer.44.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.44.30","value":"Jer.44.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 44:30"},"). This occurred in 566 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},", at the hands of Amasis (Ahmose II), who had usurped the throne of Egypt in 569 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},". Both Jeremiah (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.43.9-13","r":"Jer.43.9-13","rawR":"Jer.43.9-13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.43.9-13","value":"Jer.43.9-13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 43:9-13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.46.13-26","r":"Jer.46.13-26","rawR":"Jer.46.13-26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.46.13-26","value":"Jer.46.13-26"}],"t":"ref","v":"46:13-26"},") and Ezekiel (",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.29.1-30.26","r":"Ezek.29.1-30.26","rawR":"Ezek.29.1-30.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.29.1-30.26","value":"Ezek.29.1-30.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 29–30"},") foretold this defeat."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Hophra","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jeremiah 44:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.44.30","rawQueryValue":"Jer.44.30","sourceRefExact":"Jer.44.30"},{"anchorText":"Jer 37:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.37.5","rawQueryValue":"Jer.37.5","sourceRefExact":"Jer.37.5"},{"anchorText":"43:8-13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.43.8-13","rawQueryValue":"Jer.43.8-13","sourceRefExact":"Jer.43.8-13"},{"anchorText":"Ez 29:1-3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezek.29.1-3","rawQueryValue":"Ezek.29.1-3","sourceRefExact":"Ezek.29.1-3"},{"anchorText":"31:1-18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezek.31.1-18","rawQueryValue":"Ezek.31.1-18","sourceRefExact":"Ezek.31.1-18"},{"anchorText":"Jer 37:5-8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.37.5-8","rawQueryValue":"Jer.37.5-8","sourceRefExact":"Jer.37.5-8"},{"anchorText":"Jer 44:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.44.30","rawQueryValue":"Jer.44.30","sourceRefExact":"Jer.44.30"},{"anchorText":"Jer 43:9-13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.43.9-13","rawQueryValue":"Jer.43.9-13","sourceRefExact":"Jer.43.9-13"},{"anchorText":"46:13-26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.46.13-26","rawQueryValue":"Jer.46.13-26","sourceRefExact":"Jer.46.13-26"},{"anchorText":"Ez 29–30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezek.29.1-30.26","rawQueryValue":"Ezek.29.1-30.26","sourceRefExact":"Ezek.29.1-30.26"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"e4ecf05dfe97a76f6ec4b421d6311fb338a356901949b8981a897c1000339808","sourceItemName":"Hophra","sourceItemOrder":342,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Hophra","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Hophra","title":"Hophra","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}